        "TileImage": "$($repository 29be7684-9946-42f4-ab4d-9749bd2a66d0).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rYour destination is the train platform in Chongqing, China. ICA surveillance has identified three targets using the busy transit network to broker unredacted ICA assets. The client requires that all targets be eliminated with an explosive device to ensure total destruction of the stolen drives and to send a message.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
